@startuml
title Assignment and capacity/version checks — Proposed 2.0
skinparam shadowing false
|React Dispatcher|
start
:ListParcels Created and CourierWorkload;
if (Available courier?) then (yes)
  :AssignCourier with expectedVersion;
else (no)
  :Leave unassigned; retry later;
  stop
endif
|Delivery API|
:Lock parcel and courier capacity;
if (Role, pre-pickup state, version, zone and capacity valid?) then (yes)
  :Atomically release old assignment if reassigning;
  :Commit new assignment + history + version + outbox;
  :Return Assigned;
else (no)
  :403/409/422; no changes;
endif
stop
@enduml
